  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us6000pj4s](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us6000pj4s) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 16.31 depth occurred on Jan 10 2025 29 km SW of Bahía Solano, Colombia. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 6.0156 longitude -77.5689. It impacted 13390 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
